  "details": "I’m unsure if this is intentional, I doubt it, but in the IOS companion app, and likely the android version too, the initial menu before pressing play lets you go to your social tab and you have the option to “Boop” players, though I’ve noticed that there seems to be missing emojis. For example: you can “Boop” players with the “Broken heart” emoji.. but there isn’t a normal “Heart” emoji. That doesn’t seem right. Especially since the normal Heart emoji is usable within the actual game",
